{"event_hash": "b7c0c1ce20c8d06dacbc7805510195e79d2fa1357e23c5ccfe5b48d3bccd051a", "event_type": "hypotheses_ranked", "payload": {"hypotheses": [{"cause": "The PersistentVolumeClaim 'uploads' in namespace 'proofix-case-14' requests StorageClass 'proofix-case14-broken-local' configured with non-existent provisioner 'proofix.invalid/no-such-provisioner', causing dynamic provisioning to fail and leaving the claim in Pending phase and the pod unschedulable.", "confidence": 0.9, "contradicts": [], "discriminating_test": null, "id": "H1", "supports": ["PVC 'uploads' status phase is Pending with storageClassName 'proofix-case14-broken-local' and annotation volume.kubernetes.io/storage-provisioner set to 'proofix.invalid/no-such-provisioner'.", "Events indicate persistentvolume-controller is waiting for external provisioner 'proofix.invalid/no-such-provisioner'.", "Pod 'uploads-api-7c8dccf46b-bflzz' failed scheduling with '0/1 nodes are available: pod has unbound immediate PersistentVolumeClaims'.", "Existing PVs in the cluster successfully bound under 'local-path' with provisioner 'rancher.io/local-path'."]}, {"cause": "Node storage capacity or disk pressure on node 'vm-5' is preventing volume allocation and pod placement.", "confidence": 0.05, "contradicts": ["Node 'vm-5' status reports DiskPressure=False and has ~19.5GB allocatable ephemeral storage available.", "PVC storage request is only 64Mi.", "Event logs explicitly cite 'proofix.invalid/no-such-provisioner' missing external provisioner rather than capacity exhaustion."], "discriminating_test": null, "id": "H2", "supports": ["Pod 'uploads-api-7c8dccf46b-bflzz' reports Unschedulable on node vm-5."]}, {"cause": "The dynamic local-path storage provisioner pod/controller in the cluster is crashed or unresponsive.", "confidence": 0.05, "contradicts": ["The PVC requested 'proofix-case14-broken-local' with provisioner 'proofix.invalid/no-such-provisioner', not the valid 'local-path' provisioner.", "Multiple existing PVs in